{"4763970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Dungeon Pits", "steam_appid": 4763970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/extras/8805752b018ab1f1b26955c8508a595f.poster.avif?t=1780592552\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/extras/8805752b018ab1f1b26955c8508a595f.webm?t=1780592552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/extras/8805752b018ab1f1b26955c8508a595f.mp4?t=1780592552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash powerful skills and fight through relentless waves of undead enemies. Survive the chaos, master your timing, and push deeper into the cursed dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/extras/a0ff625dc0ac73e2446654b8d4e30bcf.poster.avif?t=1780592552\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/extras/a0ff625dc0ac73e2446654b8d4e30bcf.webm?t=1780592552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/extras/a0ff625dc0ac73e2446654b8d4e30bcf.mp4?t=1780592552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful bosses and dangerous enemies that test your timing, movement, and combat skills. Every encounter pushes you closer to the edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/extras/22eaecc56ef44766ce371066459b7837.poster.avif?t=1780592552\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/extras/22eaecc56ef44766ce371066459b7837.webm?t=1780592552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/extras/22eaecc56ef44766ce371066459b7837.mp4?t=1780592552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful abilities, upgrade your combat style, and create your own build as you fight through increasingly dangerous waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/extras/96a6fb7667442d0f942422bea97468a5.poster.avif?t=1780592552\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/extras/96a6fb7667442d0f942422bea97468a5.webm?t=1780592552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/extras/96a6fb7667442d0f942422bea97468a5.mp4?t=1780592552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the forgotten history of Medioratya through ancient texts, mysterious characters, and dark fantasy lore hidden deep within the dungeon.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/extras/8805752b018ab1f1b26955c8508a595f.poster.avif?t=1780592552\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/extras/8805752b018ab1f1b26955c8508a595f.webm?t=1780592552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https: