_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/extras/96a6fb7667442d0f942422bea97468a5.poster.avif?t=1780592552\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/extras/96a6fb7667442d0f942422bea97468a5.webm?t=1780592552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/extras/96a6fb7667442d0f942422bea97468a5.mp4?t=1780592552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the forgotten history of Medioratya through ancient texts, mysterious characters, and dark fantasy lore hidden deep within the dungeon.</p>", "short_description": "**The Dungeon Pit** is a dark fantasy action roguelite built around fast-paced combat, powerful abilities, and relentless enemy waves. Fight, upgrade, survive, and face deadly bosses as you descend deeper into a cursed dungeon filled with secrets and ancient darkness.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/d6c16d17a5c46b5ac558a4b0f0cac8a594d608a6/header.jpg?t=1780592552", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/1887e20c47abd756812bbf7198f0bbeb8215effb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780592552", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763970/1887e20c47abd756812bbf7198f0bbeb8215effb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780592552", "website": "https://rustysteelstudio.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 / Intel HD Graphic